Package: transit
Type: Package
Title: Read and Write Transit Data
Version: 0.8.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ben", "Kamphaus", email = "ben@vendekagonlabs.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Vendekagon Labs LLC", role = "cph"))
Description: Reads and writes Transit, a format for conveying values between
    applications written in different programming languages, in all three of
    its encodings: JSON, JSON-verbose and MessagePack. Values roundtrip
    losslessly, including types R has no direct equivalent for (keywords,
    sets, 64 bit integers, maps with non-string keys).
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/vendekagon-labs/transit-r, https://github.com/cognitect/transit-format
BugReports: https://github.com/vendekagon-labs/transit-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
